<title>UK: Associates Corp sets $500 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Associates Corp sets $500 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers (books) and Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASSOCIATES CORP OF NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    20.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    **+32-33 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LON/HK/SI PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK/SI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.35	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 MAY 2002 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
